 "remarks": "DIRECT WATERFRONT. Exceptional end-unit townhouse in Schooner Cove with attached garage, spectacular water views and expansive landscaped grounds. Perfectly positioned on the water overlooking the marina and Harbor Point skyline, this beautifully appointed 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath home offers an exceptional indoor-outdoor lifestyle. Relax on your private waterfront deck with morning coffee, dine outdoors, enjoy a glass of wine at sunset or simply watch the boats go by. Walk from your home to your boat! A 38-foot dock space is available upon request for an additional fee. Inside, the bright, open interior features a renovated kitchen with quartz countertops, custom cabinetry, Calacatta marble backsplash and wine refrigerator. Bamboo flooring, fireplace and power window shades enhance the main level. Both bedrooms are ensuite and all bathrooms have been beautifully renovated. The main-level primary suite features a walk-in closet and the ease of one-level living. Upstairs, the second ensuite with California Closets offers a private retreat for guests. Abundant storage includes two main-level coat closets and a spacious linen closet, plus in-unit washer/dryer. Heat and hot water included. Schooner Cove offers a pool, beautifully maintained grounds and marina access. Ideally located in Shippan, minutes from Downtown Stamford, Metro-North/Amtrak, I-95, West Beach and Cummings Park.",
